        527.4068603515625,
        115.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "People living with HIV may have an atypical clinical picture, especially those with advanced HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.38239288330078,
        527.4310913085938,
        129.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "disease, complicating the diagnosis of pulmonary and extrapulmonary forms of TB disease. Access",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.3824005126953,
        527.4276733398438,
        143.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "to a rapid and accurate diagnosis is essential to ensure that TB is effectively treated among people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.3824005126953,
        136.69229125976562,
        157.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV.",
